# This root is the GAME DIR sandbox: the packaging tool writes the boot-table
# archives + loose .sbf banks here, and the asset-gated validation step runs
# retail Jointops.exe here (dropping loose retail files while iterating).
# EVERYTHING at this root is untracked — only the authored sources in
# resources/, this .gitignore, and README.md are committed. This blanket rule
# exists because a specific-name list once let loose retail copies slip into
# a commit; never narrow it back to a name list.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/resources
!/resources/**
